                <note rend="inline" type="source">860c.516/113: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Poland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Gibson</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-09-06T16:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">September 6,
                                1921—4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>186. Your 199, August 31, 7 p.m.</p>
                <p>In your discretion, make representations as you suggest.</p>
                <p>Your 892 not yet received.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
